{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34440","headline":"和袭美初冬偶作寄南阳润卿次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美初冬偶作寄南阳润卿次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐日生涯敢计冬，可嗟寒事落然空。\n窗怜返照缘书小，庭喜新霜爲橘红。\n衰柳尚能和月动，败兰犹拟倩烟笼。\n不知海上今清浅，试与飞书问洛公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}